<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Teacher Premium Portal - SRMS</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
  /* === Global Premium Styles === */
  :root {
    --primary: #005f40;
    --primary-dark: #003d29;
    --accent: #bf953f;
    --danger: #e11d48;
    --danger-dark: #be123c;
    --warning: #f59e0b;
    --success: #10b981;
    --bg-color: #f4f7f6;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --text-main: #1e293b;
    --text-muted: #64748b;
  }
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-main); overflow-x: hidden; }
  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: 0.3s; }
  ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
  /* Animations */
  @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(25px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes bounce { 0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 40% { transform: translateY(-8px); } 60% { transform: translateY(-4px); } }
  @keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes livePulseAlert { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.45); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 15px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(225, 29, 72, 0); } }
  .animate-up { animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; opacity: 0; }

  /* Custom Scrollbar */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f1f1; border-radius: 10px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }

  /* === Premium Navbar === */
  #main-navbar { display: none; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent); }
  .nav-top-container { height: 75px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 5%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; }
  .nav-brand { font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .nav-link { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--danger); background: #fff1f2; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; }
  .nav-link:hover { color: #fff; background: var(--danger); box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.3); }

  /* === Premium Banner === */
  #main-banner { display: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark)); color: white; padding: 40px 5%; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 25px; text-align: left; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .custom-banner::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%); z-index: 0; }
  .banner-logo { width: 90px; height: 90px; background: #fff; border-radius: 50%; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); object-fit: contain; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); z-index: 1; }
  .banner-text { z-index: 1; }
  .banner-text h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  .school-codes { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); display: inline-block; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 20px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #fcf6ba; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }

  /* === Login Section === */
  #login-sec { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  #login-sec::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0,95,64,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%); z-index: -1; }
  .login-card { background: var(--card-bg); padding: 50px 40px; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); width: 100%; max-width: 450px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); box-sizing: border-box; }
  .login-logo { width: 85px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .login-title { color: var(--primary); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 5px 0; }
  .login-subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 500; }

  /* === General Form Styles === */
  input, select, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 15px 18px; margin: 10px 0; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; transition: 0.3s; box-sizing: border-box; background: #f8fafc; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500; }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: var(--primary); outline: none; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,95,64,0.1); }
  .btn-p { width: 100%; padding: 16px; background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .btn-p:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 25px -5px rgba(0,95,64,0.3); }
  .btn-p:active { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-p:disabled { background: #94a3b8; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
  .btn-success { background: #059669; } .btn-success:hover { background: #047857; }
  
  .forgot-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
  .forgot-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--primary); }
  
  .loader-spinner { border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-top: 3px solid #fff; border-radius: 50%; width: 18px; height: 18px; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px; }

  /* === Dashboard Section === */
  .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 5%; display: none; }
  
  .scroll-cue-container { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center; }
  .scroll-cue { display: inline-block; color: var(--danger); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 25px; background: #fff1f2; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #fecdd3; animation: bounce 2s infinite; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.1); }

  /* 📸 Welcome Card + Teacher Profile Avatar System */
  .welcome-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark)); color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 22px; margin-bottom: 35px; border-left: 8px solid var(--accent); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,95,64,0.22); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
  .teacher-profile-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .teacher-avatar-box { position: relative; width: 88px; height: 88px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3.5px solid var(--accent); padding: 3px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .teacher-avatar-box img { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; background: #fff; display: block; }
  .change-photo-badge { position: absolute; bottom: -2px; right: -2px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); transition: 0.25s; font-size: 13px; }
  .change-photo-badge:hover { transform: scale(1.12); background: #a67c2e; }
  .welcome-card h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 800; }
  .welcome-card p { margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.92; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; }
  .welcome-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-gold { background: var(--accent); padding: 12px 22px; border: none; color: white; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; transition: 0.3s; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(191, 149, 63, 0.3); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .btn-gold:hover { background: #a67c2e; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-outline-light { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); padding: 11px 18px; color: #fff; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; transition: 0.25s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .btn-outline-light:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .section-title { font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin: 40px 0 15px; font-size: 18px; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; }
  .card { background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 20px; padding: 35px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02); }

  .action-btn-large { width: 100%; padding: 20px; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; border: none; color: white; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .action-btn-large:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }

  /* 🎥 Embedded Live Classroom & Meeting Styles */
  .admin-live-meeting-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #be123c, #e11d48);
    color: white; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px 25px; margin-bottom: 22px;
    display: none; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px;
    animation: livePulseAlert 2s infinite; border: 2px solid #fecdd3;
  }
  .live-class-item {
    background: #f0fdf4; border: 2px solid #bbf7d0; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
  }
  .live-class-item p { margin: 3px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; }
  .btn-stop-live {
    background: var(--danger); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; transition: 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-stop-live:hover { background: var(--danger-dark); }
  .btn-rejoin-live {
    background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; transition: 0.3s;
  }

  /* File Upload Preview Box */
  .file-preview-box {
    display: none; margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 14px;
    background: #f0fdf4; border: 1.5px solid #bbf7d0; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  }
  .file-preview-box img { width: 58px; height: 58px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid var(--primary); background: #fff; }
  .file-preview-meta { flex: 1; font-size: 12.5px; color: #065f46; font-weight: 600; }

  /* Board Items */
  .notice-item { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-left: 6px solid var(--accent); transition: 0.3s; }
  .notice-item:hover { box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transform: translateX(5px); }
  .item-box { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 22px 25px; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px; position: relative; border-left: 6px solid var(--primary); transition: 0.3s; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .item-box:hover { box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
  .del-btn { color: var(--danger); cursor: pointer; font-size: 12.5px; border: 2px solid #fecdd3; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; background: #fff1f2; transition: 0.3s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .del-btn:hover { background: var(--danger); color: white; border-color: var(--danger); }
  .readonly-badge { background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .tag { background: #ecfdf5; color: var(--primary); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* Modals */
  .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); z-index: 2000; justify-content: center; align-items: center; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .modal-box { background: var(--card-bg); padding: 40px; border-radius: 28px; text-align: center; width: 100%; max-width: 480px; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease; border-top: 8px solid var(--accent); position: relative; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto;}
  .modal-box.danger-modal { border-top-color: var(--danger); }
  .close-modal-btn { background: #f1f5f9; color: #333; border: none; padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; width: 100%; transition: 0.3s; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
  .close-modal-btn:hover { background: #e2e8f0; }
  .premium-footer { display: none; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 50px 5% 30px; margin-top: 60px; text-align: center; border-top: 5px solid var(--primary); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .nav-brand { font-size: 16px; }
    .custom-banner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px; }
    .banner-text h1 { font-size: 22px; }
    .login-card { padding: 40px 25px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .container { padding: 30px 20px; }
    .welcome-card { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 28px 20px; }
    .teacher-profile-wrap { flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; }
    .welcome-card h2 { font-size: 21px; }
    .welcome-actions { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-gold, .btn-outline-light { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .card { padding: 25px 20px; }
    .item-box { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar" id="main-navbar">
  <div class="nav-top-container">
    <div class="nav-brand">
      <img id="navTeacherThumb" src="https://i.postimg.cc/hGQQqrsb/20260117_231551.png" alt="Avatar" style="width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; border:2px solid var(--accent);">
      <span>SRMS Teacher Portal</span>
    </div>
    <a onclick="logout()" class="nav-link"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i> Logout</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="custom-banner animate-up" id="main-banner">
  <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/hGQQqrsb/20260117_231551.png" class="banner-logo" alt="Logo">
  <div class="banner-text">
    <h1>Saidpur Residential Model School</h1>
    <div class="school-codes">Smart Teacher Dashboard</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="login-sec" class="animate-up">
    <div class="login-card">
        <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/hGQQqrsb/20260117_231551.png" alt="Logo" class="login-logo">
        <h2 class="login-title">Teacher Login</h2>
        <div class="login-subtitle">Access your academic dashboard</div>
        <input type="tel" id="lPh" placeholder="Mobile Number (e.g. 017...)">
        <input type="password" id="lPs" placeholder="Password">
        <button class="btn-p" id="lBtn" onclick="login()">Secure Login ➔</button>
        <div class="forgot-link" onclick="openForgotModal()">Forgot Password?</div>
        <p id="err" style="color:var(--danger); font-size:13px; margin-top:15px; font-weight:700;"></p>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="dash-sec" class="container animate-up">
    <div class="scroll-cue-container">
        <div class="scroll-cue">⬇️ Scroll down for more options ⬇️</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 📸 Welcome Card with Teacher Profile Photo & Instant Change Option -->
    <div class="welcome-card">
      <div class="teacher-profile-wrap">
        <div class="teacher-avatar-box" title="Change Profile Picture">
          <img id="teacherProfileAvatar" src="https://i.postimg.cc/hGQQqrsb/20260117_231551.png" alt="Teacher Photo" onerror="this.src='https://i.postimg.cc/hGQQqrsb/20260117_231551.png'">
          <label for="teacherPhotoInput" class="change-photo-badge" title="Change Photo">
            <i class="fas fa-camera"></i>
          </label>
          <input type="file" id="teacherPhotoInput" accept="image/*" style="display:none;" onchange="changeTeacherProfilePhoto(this)">
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 id="tGreet" style="margin:0;">Assalamu Alaikum</h2>
          <p id="tPhoneSub">Academic Management Portal</p>
          <small id="photoSyncStatus" style="display:block; margin-top:4px; color:#fde68a; font-weight:700; font-size:12px;"></small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="welcome-actions">
        <button class="btn-outline-light" onclick="document.getElementById('teacherPhotoInput').click()">
          <i class="fas fa-camera"></i> Change Photo
        </button>
        <button class="btn-gold" onclick="togglePass()">
          <i class="fas fa-key"></i> Change Key
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 🔐 Direct Password Change Box -->
    <div id="passBox" class="card" style="display:none; border-top: 5px solid var(--accent);">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--text-main);"><i class="fas fa-lock" style="color:var(--accent);"></i> সরাসরি পাসওয়ার্ড পরিবর্তন করুন</h3>
      <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:0;">নতুন পাসওয়ার্ড কমপক্ষে ৬ অক্ষরের দিন। সেভ করার সাথে সাথেই আপনার পাসওয়ার্ড পরিবর্তন হয়ে যাবে।</p>
      <input type="text" id="newPass" placeholder="নতুন পাসওয়ার্ড লিখুন (কমপক্ষে ৬ অক্ষর)">
      <button id="passBtn" class="btn-p" style="background:var(--accent);" onclick="changePass()">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Save New Password Directly
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <!-- 🎥 INTEGRATED LIVE CLASSROOM & TEACHERS' MEETING HUB -->
    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <div class="section-title">🎥 Live Classroom &amp; Meeting Studio</div>
    <div class="card" style="border-top: 6px solid var(--accent);">
        
        <!-- 🔴 Admin's Live Meeting Alert Banner -->
        <div id="teacherMeetingAlertBox" class="admin-live-meeting-banner">
            <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:800; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display:inline-block; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:20px; margin-bottom:5px;">🔴 ADMIN LIVE BROADCAST RUNNING</div>
                <h3 id="teacherMeetingTitle" style="margin:0; font-size:19px; font-weight:800;">Teachers' Official Meeting</h3>
                <p id="teacherMeetingHost" style="margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; opacity:0.95;">Hosted by: Principal / Admin</p>
            </div>
            <button id="joinAdminMeetingBtn" style="background:#fff; color:var(--danger); border:none; padding:12px 22px; border-radius:12px; font-weight:800; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
                🎥 JOIN MEETING NOW
            </button>
        </div>

        <div style="background:#fffbeb; border:1px solid #fde68a; color:#b45309; padding:12px 15px; border-radius:12px; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:18px; line-height:1.6;">
            <b>💡 নির্দেশনা:</b> আপনি নিচের ফর্ম থেকে যেকোনো শ্রেণির <b>Student Live Class</b> শুরু করতে পারবেন এবং ক্লাস শুরু হলেই শিক্ষার্থীদের কাছে স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে অফিশিয়াল <b>Push Notification</b> চলে যাবে। আর কর্তৃপক্ষ কোনো <b>Teachers' Meeting</b> শুরু করলে উপরে লাল বাটনে ক্লিক করে সরাসরি জয়েন করতে পারবেন।
        </div>

        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap:12px;">
            <div>
                <label style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-muted);">শিক্ষকের নাম (Host Name)</label>
                <input type="text" id="tLiveName" placeholder="শিক্ষকের নাম" style="margin-top:4px;">
            </div>
            <div>
                <label style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-muted);">ক্লাস নির্বাচন করুন (Students Only)</label>
                <select id="tLiveClass" style="margin-top:4px; font-weight:700; color:var(--primary);">
